  "description": "Inspect the spherical curvature centers O1/O2, their shared principal axis, surface vertices A/B, radii R1/R2 and edition-defined thickness l = |AB|. O is distinct from curvature centers. Source counts are preserved; no light-ray claim is drawn.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/10p/figures/fig-164.png",
      "sha256": "269e30150d627f2ec5238ab1a1526a2b267de81000e4ff83a77c79dcb786612a"
